==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|поганъ||pagan}}, itself borrowed from {{der|ru|la-med|pāgānus||pagan}}.

Compare typologically {{m|ru|крестья́нин}} and {{m|ru|крети́н}} (<< {{m+|la|Chrīstiānus}}, akin to {{m+|grc|Χρῑστιᾱνός}}, whence {{m|ru|христиани́н}}), also compare {{m|ru|дереве́нщина}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пога́ный}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-поганый.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|пога́ный|adv=пога́но|absn=+}}

# {{lb|ru|archaic}} [[heathen]]
#: {{syn|ru|язы́ческий<qq:modern>}}
# [[foul]], [[unclean]]
# [[lousy]], [[nasty]], [[rotten]]
# ''(mushroom)'' [[poisonous]]

====Declension====
{{ru-decl-adj|пога́ный|a}}

